# Branch lock — phase1-productname-pivot

Until Jacob says otherwise:

1. Make **all** commits, pushes, pulls, and rebases on `phase1-productname-pivot` only.
2. **Never** checkout `main` to apply product work.
3. **Never** `git push` / `git pull` / merge / rebase involving `main` or `origin/main`.
4. If not already on `phase1-productname-pivot`, switch there before any git write.
5. PRs (if asked) target review of this branch — do not merge to main unless Jacob explicitly requests it.
